
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>CareMate AI — Your Personal Health Companion</title>

    <meta name="description" content="Your personal health companion for medications, appointments, health information, and everyday care. Designed for voice-first, multilingual, accessible healthcare management.">

    <style>
        :root {
            --primary: #126b65;
            --primary-dark: #0c504b;
            --primary-light: #e6f5f1;
            --background: #f4f8f7;
            --surface: #ffffff;
            --text: #203331;
            --muted: #526561;
            --border: #d5e3df;
            --focus: #f2b544;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        html {
            font-size: 18px;
        }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
            background: var(--background);
            color: var(--text);
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        button, a, input {
            font: inherit;
        }

        button:focus-visible,
        a:focus-visible,
        input:focus-visible {
            outline: 4px solid var(--focus);
            outline-offset: 4px;
        }

        button {
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .container {
            width: min(1080px, 92%);
            margin: auto;
        }

        header {
            background: var(--surface);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
        }

        .navbar {
            min-height: 82px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 20px;
        }

        .brand {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: var(--text);
        }

        .brand-icon {
            width: 48px;
            height: 48px;
            display: grid;
            place-items: center;
            border-radius: 15px;
            background: var(--primary-light);
            color: var(--primary);
            font-size: 30px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .brand-name {
            display: block;
            font-size: 1.35rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            line-height: 1.3;
        }

        .brand-tagline {
            display: block;
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 0.76rem;
        }

        .language-button {
            padding: 10px 14px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 12px;
            background: white;
            color: var(--text);
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        main {
            padding: 36px 0 60px;
        }

        .welcome {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 28px;
        }

        .welcome-label {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 6px 14px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            background: var(--primary-light);
            color: var(--primary-dark);
            font-size: 0.82rem;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        h1 {
            margin: 16px 0 8px;
            font-size: clamp(2.1rem, 5vw, 3.2rem);
            letter-spacing: -1.2px;
            line-height: 1.15;
        }

        .welcome p {
            margin: 0 auto;
            max-width: 590px;
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 1.05rem;
        }

        /* Main voice-first interaction */

        .voice-panel {
            max-width: 760px;
            margin: auto;
            padding: 32px 24px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 28px;
            background: var(--surface);
            box-shadow: 0 12px 35px rgba(18, 75, 67, 0.07);
            text-align: center;
        }

        .assistant-status {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 9px;
            color: var(--primary-dark);
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        .status-dot {
            width: 11px;
            height: 11px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: #2c9772;
        }

        .voice-heading {
            margin: 12px 0 4px;
            font-size: clamp(1.55rem, 4vw, 2rem);
            line-height: 1.3;
        }

        .voice-description {
            margin: 0 auto 22px;
            max-width: 480px;
            color: var(--muted);
        }

        .voice-button {
            width: 184px;
            height: 184px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 7px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            border: 8px solid var(--primary-light);
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: var(--primary);
            color: white;
            box-shadow: 0 7px 0 rgba(18, 107, 101, 0.12);
            transition: transform 0.2s, background 0.2s;
        }

        .voice-button:hover {
            background: var(--primary-dark);
            transform: scale(1.03);
        }

        .voice-button:active {
            transform: scale(0.98);
        }

        .microphone {
            font-size: 53px;
            line-height: 1.2;
        }

        .voice-button-label {
            font-size: 1.15rem;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .voice-instruction {
            margin: 19px 0 5px;
            font-size: 1rem;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .voice-caption {
            margin: 0;
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 0.85rem;
        }

        .mockup-notice {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 17px;
            padding: 6px 11px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            background: #f2f3f3;
            color: #4e5957;
            font-size: 0.76rem;
        }

        .response {
            min-height: 28px;
            margin: 12px 0 0;
            color: var(--primary-dark);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        /* Secondary navigation */

        .quick-actions {
            margin-top: 38px;
        }

        .section-heading {
            margin: 0 0 5px;
            font-size: 1.45rem;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .section-description {
            margin: 0 auto 20px;
            text-align: center;
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 0.92rem;
        }

        .action-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
            gap: 16px;
        }

        .action-card {
            min-height: 145px;
            padding: 20px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 18px;
            background: var(--surface);
            color: var(--text);
            text-align: left;
            transition: border-color 0.2s, transform 0.2s;
        }

        .action-card:hover {
            border-color: var(--primary);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        .action-icon {
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            font-size: 30px;
        }

        .action-title {
            display: block;
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .action-description {
            display: block;
            margin-top: 4px;
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 0.82rem;
        }

        .accessibility-note {
            max-width: 760px;
            margin: 30px auto 0;
            padding: 17px 20px;
            border-left: 5px solid var(--primary);
            border-radius: 8px;
            background: var(--primary-light);
            color: var(--primary-dark);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        footer {
            padding: 24px 0;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
            background: white;
            color: var(--muted);
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
        }

        @media (max-width: 650px) {
            html {
                font-size: 17px;
            }

            main {
                padding-top: 28px;
            }

            .navbar {
                min-height: 72px;
            }

            .brand-tagline {
                max-width: 190px;
            }

            .voice-panel {
                padding: 27px 17px;
            }

            .voice-button {
                width: 165px;
                height: 165px;
            }

            .action-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .action-card {
                min-height: 110px;
            }
        }

        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
            *,
            *::before,
            *::after {
                scroll-behavior: auto !important;
                transition: none !important;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <header>
        <nav class="container navbar" aria-label="Main navigation">
            <a class="brand" href="#" aria-label="CareMate AI home">
                <span class="brand-icon" aria-hidden="true">✚</span>
                <span>
                    <span class="brand-name">CareMate AI</span>
                    <span class="brand-tagline">Your health, your companion.</span>
                </span>
            </a>

            <button class="language-button" type="button"
                    onclick="showMockupMessage('Language selection is a mockup and is not connected yet.')">
                🌐 English ▾
            </button>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <main class="container">
        <section class="welcome" aria-labelledby="welcome-title">
            <span class="welcome-label">YOUR PERSONAL HEALTH COMPANION</span>
            <h1 id="welcome-title">Hello! How can I help you today?</h1>
            <p>
                Your health matters. Just speak naturally, and let your
                personal health companion help you stay organized and
                feel more confident about your daily care.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="voice-panel" aria-labelledby="voice-heading">
            <div class="assistant-status">
                <span class="status-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                Your AI assistant
            </div>

            <h2 class="voice-heading" id="voice-heading">
                I'm here to help.
            </h2>

            <p class="voice-description">
                You don't need to type or navigate complicated menus.
                Start with your voice, or choose a task below.
            </p>

            <button class="voice-button" type="button"
                    aria-label="Start voice assistant, mockup only"
                    onclick="showMockupMessage('Voice assistance is a mockup. Microphone access and speech recognition are not implemented yet.')">
                <span class="microphone" aria-hidden="true">🎙</span>
                <span class="voice-button-label">Talk to me</span>
            </button>

            <p class="voice-instruction">
                Tap the microphone to get started
            </p>

            <p class="voice-caption">
                Speak in your own words and at your own pace.
            </p>

            <span class="mockup-notice">
                Prototype preview · Voice features not connected
            </span>

            <p class="response" id="response" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
        </section>

        <section class="quick-actions" aria-labelledby="actions-heading">
            <h2 class="section-heading" id="actions-heading">
                Or choose what you need
            </h2>

            <p class="section-description">
                Your most important health tasks, all in one place.
            </p>

            <div class="action-grid">
                <button class="action-card" type="button"
                        onclick="showMockupMessage('Medication management is a mockup. No medication information is stored or changed.')">
                    <span class="action-icon" aria-hidden="true">💊</span>
                    <span class="action-title">My Medications</span>
                    <span class="action-description">
                        View medication schedules and reminders.
                    </span>
                </button>

                <button class="action-card" type="button"
                        onclick="showMockupMessage('Appointment management is a mockup. No appointments can be booked yet.')">
                    <span class="action-icon" aria-hidden="true">📅</span>
                    <span class="action-title">Appointments</span>
                    <span class="action-description">
                        Keep track of visits and upcoming checkups.
                    </span>
                </button>

                <button class="action-card" type="button"
                        onclick="showMockupMessage('Health information is a mockup. No medical records are connected.')">
                    <span class="action-icon" aria-hidden="true">🩺</span>
                    <span class="action-title">My Health</span>
                    <span class="action-description">
                        Organize important health information.
                    </span>
                </button>
            </div>
        </section>

        <aside class="accessibility-note">
            <strong>Made for everyone.</strong>
            CareMate AI is designed with older adults, people with
            visual impairments, individuals managing medical needs,
            and family caregivers in mind. The full product will aim
            to support voice interaction, readable text, and multiple
            languages.
        </aside>
    </main>

    <footer>
        <div class="container">
            CareMate AI · A personal health companion concept.
            <br>
            This prototype is not medical advice and does not provide
            emergency assistance.
        </div>
    </footer>

    <script>
        /*
         * MOCKUP ONLY:
         * This page does not connect to an AI model, microphone,
         * speech recognition, medical records, or appointment systems.
         * The messages below are demonstrations of the intended UI.
         */

        function showMockupMessage(message) {
            document.getElementById("response").textContent = message;
        }
    </script>
</body>
</html>
